<title>JAPAN: Kyocera shares up on high-tech demand.</title>
<headline>Kyocera shares up on high-tech demand.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Kyocera Corporation jumped on Wednesday morning as a buying trend covering high-technology issues widened, traders said.</p>
<p>At 0121 GMT, the ceramic package maker was up 390 yen at 8,900, making it the seventh largest percentage gainer on the first section of the Tokyo Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>Turnover was about 1.11 million shares.</p>
</text>
